{{define "actions_craftsman.tmpl"}}
AVAILABLE ACTIONS (in priority order for craftsmen):

CRAFTING - Your primary activity:
- "craft" - Craft items from a recipe (requires target: recipe ID, e.g. "basic_smelt_iron")
- "get_recipes" - List available crafting recipes and requirements

MATERIAL MANAGEMENT:
- "buy" - Buy materials from station market (requires target: item ID)
- "sell" - Sell crafted goods at station (requires target: item ID)
- "get_listings" - Check current market prices and listings

MOVEMENT - Get to where you need to be:
- "undock" - Leave the current station (must be docked)
- "dock" - Dock at your current POI (must be undocked, at a dockable POI)
- "travel" - Travel to a POI in current system (requires target: exact POI ID)
- "jump" - Jump to another star system (requires target: system name)

SHIP MAINTENANCE:
- "refuel" - Refuel at station (must be docked)
- "repair" - Repair hull at station (must be docked)
- "mine" - Mine resources at an asteroid belt (must be at belt/asteroid_field POI)

INFORMATION (free, no tick cost - use sparingly):
- "get_status" - Get your current player status
- "get_ship" - Get ship details and cargo contents
- "get_system" - Discover POIs and connections in current system
- "get_skills" - Check your skill levels and XP progress

OTHER:
- "wait" - Do nothing this turn (only when traveling or truly nothing to do)
{{end}}